Summon a Fire Drake for [3, 4, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] turns to burn and crush your foes to death. Fire Drakes are behemoths that can burn foes from afar with their fiery breath.

It will get [55, 101, 142, 179, 215 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Strength, [50, 84, 115, 143, 170 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Constitution and 38 Willpower.

Your summons inherit some of your stats: increased damage%, resistance penetration %, stun/pin/confusion/blindness resistance, armour penetration.

Their Strength and Constitution will increase with your Mindpower.
